 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "stauden.de・おぎはら楽天（品種）: 花後の花茎を切る。RHS・Walters: 早春に徒長した茎を切り、春に古葉を整える、秋は切らない。夏前・夏の切り戻しの記述はなく、機械の C は取り違え。RHS の「毎年マルチか植え直し」は毎年の株更新の明記ではないので D にしない（試作の例と同じ B）",
  "management_type_quote": "花後の花茎を切る程度",
  "management_type_by_matching": "C 夏前切戻型",
  "heat_west_only": "中",
  "muggy_west_only": "中",
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/品種] 耐暑性；中\n[おぎはら楽天/品種] 耐暑性: 普通（暖地では夏に風とおし、水はけよく）（蒸れ 中 相当）\n[おぎはら楽天/品種] 日照 寒冷地: 日向(適湿）〜半日陰／暖地: 半日陰（西日 × 相当）\n[MBG/品種] Scorch and general foliage decline may occur if soils are allowed to dry out.\n[NC State/属] Most plants in this genus prefer relatively dry air, but hairy alumroot ( Heuchera villosa ) will thrive in heat and high humidity.\n[NC State/属] Insects, Diseases, and Other Plant Problems: There are few insect or disease problems, but leaf scorch can be a problem for plants grown in full sun during hot, dry conditions.\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: West-facing or South-facing or North-facing or East-facing",
  "spread_evidence": null,
  "mixing_evidence": "[stauden.de・品種] Wuchsverhalten: horstig, lockerhorstig, horstbildend",
  "silhouette_evidence": "[MBG・品種] The rounded, lobed, long-petioled leaves form a basal mound (to 9” tall) which may spread to 16” wide.",
